 "turns": [
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D001",
   "turn_index": 0,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "西川さん、こんばんは。パクです。明日の植物園の予定を読みました。今、電話で話してもいいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D001-S01",
    "C26-D001-S02",
    "C26-D001-S03",
    "C26-D001-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 0.0,
   "end_sec": 6.762,
   "duration_sec": 6.762
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D002",
   "turn_index": 1,
   "speaker": "西川",
   "source_text": "はい、大丈夫ですよ。明日は小雨の予報ですね。雨のときの予定も読みましたか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D002-S01",
    "C26-D002-S02",
    "C26-D002-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 7.112,
   "end_sec": 14.076,
   "duration_sec": 6.964
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D003",
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "はい。でも、朝の予報が大雨だったら、行きませんね。何時のメッセージを見ますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D003-S01",
    "C26-D003-S02",
    "C26-D003-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 14.426,
   "end_sec": 20.456,
   "duration_sec": 6.03
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D004",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "西川",
   "source_text": "7時です。全員に送ります。大雨の日は中止です。予備の日の28日に行きましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D004-S01",
    "C26-D004-S02",
    "C26-D004-S03",
    "C26-D004-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 20.806,
   "end_sec": 28.302,
   "duration_sec": 7.496
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D005",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "28日は都合がいいです。明日は出かける前にメッセージを見ます。電車が運休だったら、家にいます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D005-S01",
    "C26-D005-S02",
    "C26-D005-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 28.652,
   "end_sec": 35.39,
   "duration_sec": 6.738
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D006",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "西川",
   "source_text": "はい。電車が遅れたら、わたしに連絡してください。10時30分まで駅で待ちます。急がなくても大丈夫ですよ。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D006-S01",
    "C26-D006-S02",
    "C26-D006-S03",
    "C26-D006-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 35.74,
   "end_sec": 43.929,
   "duration_sec": 8.189
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D017",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "西川さん、パクです。今、駅に着きました。昨日はメッセージをありがとうございました。カリムさんが見えません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D017-S01",
    "C26-D017-S02",
    "C26-D017-S03",
    "C26-D017-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 44.829,
   "end_sec": 52.017,
   "duration_sec": 7.188
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D018",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "西川",
   "source_text": "おはようございます。カリムさんは東口で待っていますよ。出口の前に大きい地図がありますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D018-S01",
    "C26-D018-S02",
    "C26-D018-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 52.367,
   "end_sec": 59.191,
   "duration_sec": 6.824
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D019",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "いいえ。店と時計があります。出口を間違えましたか。今、地図を見ています。でも、東口を探せません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D019-S01",
    "C26-D019-S02",
    "C26-D019-S03",
    "C26-D019-S04",
    "C26-D019-S05"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 59.541,
   "end_sec": 68.173,
   "duration_sec": 8.632
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D020",
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "西川",
   "source_text": "そこは西口ですね。時計の下で待ってください。カリムさんに迎えに行ってもらいます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D020-S01",
    "C26-D020-S02",
    "C26-D020-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 68.523,
   "end_sec": 74.304,
   "duration_sec": 5.781
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D021",
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "お願いします。それから、傘を家に忘れました。夜、準備をしました。でも、傘はかばんに入れなかったんです。家に戻りましょうか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D021-S01",
    "C26-D021-S02",
    "C26-D021-S03",
    "C26-D021-S04",
    "C26-D021-S05"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 74.654,
   "end_sec": 85.03,
   "duration_sec": 10.376
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D022",
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "西川",
   "source_text": "いいえ。予備の傘がありますから、貸しますよ。傘を忘れても、今日は大丈夫です。家は遠いですから、ここで借りてください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D022-S01",
    "C26-D022-S02",
    "C26-D022-S03",
    "C26-D022-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": true,
   "review_flags": [
    "clip_asr_difference",
    "low_ASR_text_match"
   ],
   "start_sec": 85.38,
   "end_sec": 94.305,
   "duration_sec": 8.925
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D023",
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "助かります。今日の午前は温室ですね。午後も雨だったら、温室で写真を撮りますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D023-S01",
    "C26-D023-S02",
    "C26-D023-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 94.655,
   "end_sec": 100.961,
   "duration_sec": 6.306
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D024",
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "西川",
   "source_text": "はい。雨が止んだら屋外に出ます。まだ降っていたら、温室で写真を撮りましょう。15時に帰ります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D024-S01",
    "C26-D024-S02",
    "C26-D024-S03",
    "C26-D024-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 101.311,
   "end_sec": 109.688,
   "duration_sec": 8.377
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D025",
   "turn_index": 14,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "はい。カリムさんが見えました。一緒に東口に行きます。着いたら、傘を借りてもいいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D025-S01",
    "C26-D025-S02",
    "C26-D025-S03",
    "C26-D025-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 110.038,
   "end_sec": 116.226,
   "duration_sec": 6.188
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D026",
   "turn_index": 15,
   "speaker": "西川",
   "source_text": "はい、東口で貸します。今はまだ9時57分です。集合の10時に間に合いますよ。東口で待っています。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D026-S01",
    "C26-D026-S02",
    "C26-D026-S03",
    "C26-D026-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 116.576,
   "end_sec": 125.36,
   "duration_sec": 8.784
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D029",
   "turn_index": 16,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "今日はありがとうございました。来月は寮を出て、友達と二人暮らしをしたいんです。帰りの電車で、部屋の写真を見てもらってもいいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D029-S01",
    "C26-D029-S02",
    "C26-D029-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 126.26,
   "end_sec": 134.966,
   "duration_sec": 8.706
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D030",
   "turn_index": 17,
   "speaker": "西川",
   "source_text": "いいですよ。この家は川の中の島にあるんですね。両岸に橋がありますか。大雨の日の道も確認したいですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D030-S01",
    "C26-D030-S02",
    "C26-D030-S03",
    "C26-D030-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 135.316,
   "end_sec": 144.489,
   "duration_sec": 9.173
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D031",
   "turn_index": 18,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "橋は二つあります。でも、通行止めの日もあります。それで、駅の近くの家も探しています。なるべく駅から離れない場所がいいです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D031-S01",
    "C26-D031-S02",
    "C26-D031-S03",
    "C26-D031-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 144.839,
   "end_sec": 154.587,
   "duration_sec": 9.748
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D032",
   "turn_index": 19,
   "speaker": "西川",
   "source_text": "この二枚目の写真は、下町の家ですか。古い町並がきれいですね。首都の大都会にも、こんな静かな場所があるんですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D032-S01",
    "C26-D032-S02",
    "C26-D032-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 154.937,
   "end_sec": 164.074,
   "duration_sec": 9.137
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D033",
   "turn_index": 20,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "はい。友達の自宅の近くです。一階に台所と浴室、二階に寝室があります。最上階も二階です。ベランダはありません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D033-S01",
    "C26-D033-S02",
    "C26-D033-S03",
    "C26-D033-S04",
    "C26-D033-S05"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 164.424,
   "end_sec": 174.404,
   "duration_sec": 9.98
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D034",
   "turn_index": 21,
   "speaker": "西川",
   "source_text": "二人の家具は全部入りますか。ベッドを二つ入れたら、机の場所がありませんね。本棚の場所も必要です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D034-S01",
    "C26-D034-S02",
    "C26-D034-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 174.754,
   "end_sec": 182.539,
   "duration_sec": 7.785
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D035",
   "turn_index": 22,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "寝室は狭くてもかまいません。でも、机は二つ必要です。窓際に一つ、壁の前に一つ置きたいです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D035-S01",
    "C26-D035-S02",
    "C26-D035-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 182.889,
   "end_sec": 190.622,
   "duration_sec": 7.733
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D036",
   "turn_index": 23,
   "speaker": "西川",
   "source_text": "台所の奥の戸棚は大きいですね。サイドボードも買いますか。食器はこの棚に全部入りますよ。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D036-S01",
    "C26-D036-S02",
    "C26-D036-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 190.972,
   "end_sec": 199.162,
   "duration_sec": 8.19
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D037",
   "turn_index": 24,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "それなら、今は買いません。引っ越しの費用とは別に、家具のお金も必要ですから。まず、ある物を使います。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D037-S01",
    "C26-D037-S02",
    "C26-D037-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 199.512,
   "end_sec": 207.209,
   "duration_sec": 7.697
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D038",
   "turn_index": 25,
   "speaker": "西川",
   "source_text": "玄関の鏡は今の寮の鏡に似ていますね。あ、この戸の裏側にも収納があります。傘はここに置けますね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D038-S01",
    "C26-D038-S02",
    "C26-D038-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 207.559,
   "end_sec": 217.094,
   "duration_sec": 9.535
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D039",
   "turn_index": 26,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "はい。帰ったとき、すぐ置けます。部屋を出るときも忘れません。こちらは和室です。床の間に花びんがあります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D039-S01",
    "C26-D039-S02",
    "C26-D039-S03",
    "C26-D039-S04",
    "C26-D039-S05"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 217.444,
   "end_sec": 225.294,
   "duration_sec": 7.85
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D040",
   "turn_index": 27,
   "speaker": "西川",
   "source_text": "友達が来たら、ここで話せますね。椅子が足りなかったら、座布団でもいいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D040-S01",
    "C26-D040-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 225.644,
   "end_sec": 231.337,
   "duration_sec": 5.693
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D041",
   "turn_index": 28,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "はい、友達も座布団が好きです。小さいボックスにお茶の道具を入れて、この部屋で使いたいです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D041-S01",
    "C26-D041-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 231.687,
   "end_sec": 237.935,
   "duration_sec": 6.248
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D042",
   "turn_index": 29,
   "speaker": "西川",
   "source_text": "今の生活と同じ時間に出かけられますか。地図では駅の出口が寮のときと違いますね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D042-S01",
    "C26-D042-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 238.285,
   "end_sec": 245.093,
   "duration_sec": 6.808
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D043",
   "turn_index": 30,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "はい。電車の時間に合わせて、朝の準備を早めます。家を見る日は、友達の休みに合わせます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D043-S01",
    "C26-D043-S02",
    "C26-D043-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 245.443,
   "end_sec": 252.116,
   "duration_sec": 6.673
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C26-D044",
   "turn_index": 31,
   "speaker": "西川",
   "source_text": "晴れても雨が降っても、屋内の写真は撮れますね。でも、もしも大雨だったら、見る日を変えましょう。道に気をつけて行ってください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C26-D044-S01",
    "C26-D044-S02",
    "C26-D044-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 252.466,
   "end_sec": 261.354,
   "duration_sec": 8.888
  }
 ],
