   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "パクです。",
   "start_sec": 1.4,
   "end_sec": 2.225,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D001-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D001",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "明日の植物園の予定を読みました。",
   "start_sec": 2.375,
   "end_sec": 4.729,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D001-S04",
   "unit_id": "C26-D001",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "今、電話で話してもいいですか。",
   "start_sec": 4.879,
   "end_sec": 6.762,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D002-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D002",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "はい、大丈夫ですよ。",
   "start_sec": 7.112,
   "end_sec": 8.978,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D002-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D002",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "明日は小雨の予報ですね。",
   "start_sec": 9.128,
   "end_sec": 11.511,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D002-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D002",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "雨のときの予定も読みましたか。",
   "start_sec": 11.661,
   "end_sec": 14.076,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D003-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D003",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "はい。",
   "start_sec": 14.426,
   "end_sec": 15.231,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D003-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D003",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "でも、朝の予報が大雨だったら、行きませんね。",
   "start_sec": 15.381,
   "end_sec": 18.476,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D003-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D003",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "何時のメッセージを見ますか。",
   "start_sec": 18.626,
   "end_sec": 20.456,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D004-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D004",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "7時です。",
   "start_sec": 20.806,
   "end_sec": 21.705,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D004-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D004",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "全員に送ります。",
   "start_sec": 21.855,
   "end_sec": 23.443,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D004-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D004",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "大雨の日は中止です。",
   "start_sec": 23.593,
   "end_sec": 25.488,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D004-S04",
   "unit_id": "C26-D004",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "予備の日の28日に行きましょう。",
   "start_sec": 25.638,
   "end_sec": 28.302,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D005-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D005",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "28日は都合がいいです。",
   "start_sec": 28.652,
   "end_sec": 30.938,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D005-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D005",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "明日は出かける前にメッセージを見ます。",
   "start_sec": 31.088,
   "end_sec": 33.323,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D005-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D005",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "電車が運休だったら、家にいます。",
   "start_sec": 33.473,
   "end_sec": 35.39,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D006-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D006",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "はい。",
   "start_sec": 35.74,
   "end_sec": 36.373,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D006-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D006",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "電車が遅れたら、わたしに連絡してください。",
   "start_sec": 36.523,
   "end_sec": 39.471,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D006-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D006",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "10時30分まで駅で待ちます。",
   "start_sec": 39.621,
   "end_sec": 42.1,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D006-S04",
   "unit_id": "C26-D006",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "急がなくても大丈夫ですよ。",
   "start_sec": 42.25,
   "end_sec": 43.929,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D017-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D017",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "西川さん、パクです。",
   "start_sec": 44.829,
   "end_sec": 46.144,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D017-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D017",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "今、駅に着きました。",
   "start_sec": 46.294,
   "end_sec": 47.874,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D017-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D017",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "昨日はメッセージをありがとうございました。",
   "start_sec": 48.024,
   "end_sec": 50.242,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D017-S04",
   "unit_id": "C26-D017",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "カリムさんが見えません。",
   "start_sec": 50.392,
   "end_sec": 52.017,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D018-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D018",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "おはようございます。",
   "start_sec": 52.367,
   "end_sec": 53.589,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D018-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D018",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "カリムさんは東口で待っていますよ。",
   "start_sec": 53.739,
   "end_sec": 56.411,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D018-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D018",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "出口の前に大きい地図がありますか。",
   "start_sec": 56.561,
   "end_sec": 59.191,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D019-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D019",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "いいえ。",
   "start_sec": 59.541,
   "end_sec": 60.356,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D019-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D019",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "店と時計があります。",
   "start_sec": 60.506,
   "end_sec": 62.091,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D019-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D019",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "出口を間違えましたか。",
   "start_sec": 62.241,
   "end_sec": 64.264,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D019-S04",
   "unit_id": "C26-D019",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "今、地図を見ています。",
   "start_sec": 64.414,
   "end_sec": 65.734,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D019-S05",
   "unit_id": "C26-D019",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "でも、東口を探せません。",
   "start_sec": 65.884,
   "end_sec": 68.173,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D020-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D020",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "そこは西口ですね。",
   "start_sec": 68.523,
   "end_sec": 70.355,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D020-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D020",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "時計の下で待ってください。",
   "start_sec": 70.505,
   "end_sec": 72.278,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D020-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D020",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "カリムさんに迎えに行ってもらいます。",
   "start_sec": 72.428,
   "end_sec": 74.304,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D021-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D021",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "お願いします。",
   "start_sec": 74.654,
   "end_sec": 75.739,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D021-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D021",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "それから、傘を家に忘れました。",
   "start_sec": 75.889,
   "end_sec": 79.141,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D021-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D021",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "夜、準備をしました。",
   "start_sec": 79.291,
   "end_sec": 80.85,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D021-S04",
   "unit_id": "C26-D021",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "でも、傘はかばんに入れなかったんです。",
   "start_sec": 81.0,
   "end_sec": 83.57,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D021-S05",
   "unit_id": "C26-D021",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "家に戻りましょうか。",
   "start_sec": 83.72,
   "end_sec": 85.03,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D022-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D022",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "いいえ。",
   "start_sec": 85.38,
   "end_sec": 85.802,
   "review_flags": [
    "low_ASR_text_match",
    "clip_asr_difference"
   ],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D022-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D022",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "予備の傘がありますから、貸しますよ。",
   "start_sec": 85.952,
   "end_sec": 88.349,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D022-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D022",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "傘を忘れても、今日は大丈夫です。",
   "start_sec": 88.499,
   "end_sec": 91.288,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D022-S04",
   "unit_id": "C26-D022",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "家は遠いですから、ここで借りてください。",
   "start_sec": 91.438,
   "end_sec": 94.305,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D023-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D023",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "助かります。",
   "start_sec": 94.655,
   "end_sec": 95.855,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D023-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D023",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "今日の午前は温室ですね。",
   "start_sec": 96.005,
   "end_sec": 97.901,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D023-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D023",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "午後も雨だったら、温室で写真を撮りますか。",
   "start_sec": 98.051,
   "end_sec": 100.961,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D024-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D024",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "はい。",
   "start_sec": 101.311,
   "end_sec": 102.201,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D024-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D024",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "雨が止んだら屋外に出ます。",
   "start_sec": 102.351,
   "end_sec": 104.602,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D024-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D024",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "まだ降っていたら、温室で写真を撮りましょう。",
   "start_sec": 104.752,
   "end_sec": 108.142,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D024-S04",
   "unit_id": "C26-D024",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "15時に帰ります。",
   "start_sec": 108.292,
   "end_sec": 109.688,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D025-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D025",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "はい。",
   "start_sec": 110.038,
   "end_sec": 110.63,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D025-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D025",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "カリムさんが見えました。",
   "start_sec": 110.78,
   "end_sec": 112.216,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D025-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D025",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "一緒に東口に行きます。",
   "start_sec": 112.366,
   "end_sec": 114.076,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D025-S04",
   "unit_id": "C26-D025",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "着いたら、傘を借りてもいいですか。",
   "start_sec": 114.226,
   "end_sec": 116.226,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D026-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D026",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "はい、東口で貸します。",
   "start_sec": 116.576,
   "end_sec": 119.137,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D026-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D026",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "今はまだ9時57分です。",
   "start_sec": 119.287,
   "end_sec": 121.499,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D026-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D026",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "集合の10時に間に合いますよ。",
   "start_sec": 121.649,
   "end_sec": 123.765,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D026-S04",
   "unit_id": "C26-D026",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "東口で待っています。",
   "start_sec": 123.915,
   "end_sec": 125.36,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D029-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D029",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "今日はありがとうございました。",
   "start_sec": 126.26,
   "end_sec": 128.11,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D029-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D029",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "来月は寮を出て、友達と二人暮らしをしたいんです。",
   "start_sec": 128.26,
   "end_sec": 131.86,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D029-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D029",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "帰りの電車で、部屋の写真を見てもらってもいいですか。",
   "start_sec": 132.01,
   "end_sec": 134.966,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D030-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D030",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "いいですよ。",
   "start_sec": 135.316,
   "end_sec": 136.305,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D030-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D030",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "この家は川の中の島にあるんですね。",
   "start_sec": 136.455,
   "end_sec": 139.727,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D030-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D030",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "両岸に橋がありますか。",
   "start_sec": 139.877,
   "end_sec": 141.929,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D030-S04",
   "unit_id": "C26-D030",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "大雨の日の道も確認したいですね。",
   "start_sec": 142.079,
   "end_sec": 144.489,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D031-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D031",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "橋は二つあります。",
   "start_sec": 144.839,
   "end_sec": 146.481,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D031-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D031",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "でも、通行止めの日もあります。",
   "start_sec": 146.631,
   "end_sec": 148.974,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D031-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D031",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "それで、駅の近くの家も探しています。",
   "start_sec": 149.124,
   "end_sec": 151.879,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D031-S04",
   "unit_id": "C26-D031",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "なるべく駅から離れない場所がいいです。",
   "start_sec": 152.029,
   "end_sec": 154.587,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D032-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D032",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "この二枚目の写真は、下町の家ですか。",
   "start_sec": 154.937,
   "end_sec": 158.308,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D032-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D032",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "古い町並がきれいですね。",
   "start_sec": 158.458,
   "end_sec": 160.541,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D032-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D032",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "首都の大都会にも、こんな静かな場所があるんですね。",
   "start_sec": 160.691,
   "end_sec": 164.074,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D033-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D033",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "はい。",
   "start_sec": 164.424,
   "end_sec": 165.194,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D033-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D033",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "友達の自宅の近くです。",
   "start_sec": 165.344,
   "end_sec": 167.216,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D033-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D033",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "一階に台所と浴室、二階に寝室があります。",
   "start_sec": 167.366,
   "end_sec": 171.453,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D033-S04",
   "unit_id": "C26-D033",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "最上階も二階です。",
   "start_sec": 171.603,
   "end_sec": 173.078,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D033-S05",
   "unit_id": "C26-D033",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "ベランダはありません。",
   "start_sec": 173.228,
   "end_sec": 174.404,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D034-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D034",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "二人の家具は全部入りますか。",
   "start_sec": 174.754,
   "end_sec": 176.883,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D034-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D034",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "ベッドを二つ入れたら、机の場所がありませんね。",
   "start_sec": 177.033,
   "end_sec": 180.639,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D034-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D034",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "本棚の場所も必要です。",
   "start_sec": 180.789,
   "end_sec": 182.539,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D035-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D035",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "寝室は狭くてもかまいません。",
   "start_sec": 182.889,
   "end_sec": 184.963,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D035-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D035",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "でも、机は二つ必要です。",
   "start_sec": 185.113,
   "end_sec": 187.346,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D035-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D035",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "窓際に一つ、壁の前に一つ置きたいです。",
   "start_sec": 187.496,
   "end_sec": 190.622,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D036-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D036",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "台所の奥の戸棚は大きいですね。",
   "start_sec": 190.972,
   "end_sec": 193.911,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D036-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D036",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "サイドボードも買いますか。",
   "start_sec": 194.061,
   "end_sec": 196.045,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D036-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D036",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "食器はこの棚に全部入りますよ。",
   "start_sec": 196.195,
   "end_sec": 199.162,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D037-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D037",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "それなら、今は買いません。",
   "start_sec": 199.512,
   "end_sec": 201.686,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D037-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D037",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "引っ越しの費用とは別に、家具のお金も必要ですから。",
   "start_sec": 201.836,
   "end_sec": 205.271,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D037-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D037",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "まず、ある物を使います。",
   "start_sec": 205.421,
   "end_sec": 207.209,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D038-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D038",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "玄関の鏡は今の寮の鏡に似ていますね。",
   "start_sec": 207.559,
   "end_sec": 211.445,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D038-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D038",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "あ、この戸の裏側にも収納があります。",
   "start_sec": 211.595,
   "end_sec": 215.338,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D038-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D038",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "傘はここに置けますね。",
   "start_sec": 215.488,
   "end_sec": 217.094,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D039-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D039",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "はい。",
   "start_sec": 217.444,
   "end_sec": 218.094,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D039-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D039",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "帰ったとき、すぐ置けます。",
   "start_sec": 218.244,
   "end_sec": 219.849,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D039-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D039",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "部屋を出るときも忘れません。",
   "start_sec": 219.999,
   "end_sec": 221.715,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D039-S04",
   "unit_id": "C26-D039",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "こちらは和室です。",
   "start_sec": 221.865,
   "end_sec": 223.221,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D039-S05",
   "unit_id": "C26-D039",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "床の間に花びんがあります。",
   "start_sec": 223.371,
   "end_sec": 225.294,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D040-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D040",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "友達が来たら、ここで話せますね。",
   "start_sec": 225.644,
   "end_sec": 228.179,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D040-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D040",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "椅子が足りなかったら、座布団でもいいですか。",
   "start_sec": 228.329,
   "end_sec": 231.337,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D041-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D041",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "はい、友達も座布団が好きです。",
   "start_sec": 231.687,
   "end_sec": 234.226,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D041-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D041",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "小さいボックスにお茶の道具を入れて、この部屋で使いたいです。",
   "start_sec": 234.376,
   "end_sec": 237.935,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D042-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D042",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "今の生活と同じ時間に出かけられますか。",
   "start_sec": 238.285,
   "end_sec": 241.294,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D042-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D042",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "地図では駅の出口が寮のときと違いますね。",
   "start_sec": 241.444,
   "end_sec": 245.093,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D043-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D043",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "はい。",
   "start_sec": 245.443,
   "end_sec": 246.152,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D043-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D043",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "電車の時間に合わせて、朝の準備を早めます。",
   "start_sec": 246.302,
   "end_sec": 249.27,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D043-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D043",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "家を見る日は、友達の休みに合わせます。",
   "start_sec": 249.42,
   "end_sec": 252.116,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D044-S01",
   "unit_id": "C26-D044",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "晴れても雨が降っても、屋内の写真は撮れますね。",
   "start_sec": 252.466,
   "end_sec": 255.619,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D044-S02",
   "unit_id": "C26-D044",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "でも、もしも大雨だったら、見る日を変えましょう。",
   "start_sec": 255.769,
   "end_sec": 259.56,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C26-D044-S03",
   "unit_id": "C26-D044",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "西川",
   "text": "道に気をつけて行ってください。",
   "start_sec": 259.71,
   "end_sec": 261.354,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  }
 ]
}
